sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as LibraryChatPage
    participant LS as LibraryService
    participant LLM as SummarizationService

    User->>UI: "What was said about AI?"
    UI->>LS: GetRelevantContentForChatAsync(query)

    alt "latest" / "recent" query
        LS->>LS: Return 3 most recent entries
    else Standard query
        LS->>LS: Search entries by keyword
        LS->>LS: Limit to 5 results
        alt No results
            LS->>LS: Fallback to 3 most recent
        end
    end

    LS-->>UI: Formatted context block (Record entries)
    UI->>LLM: ChatWithContextAsync(context, question)

    alt Model needs loading
        LLM->>LLM: LoadModelAsync()
    end

    LLM->>LLM: Truncate context to model window
    Note over LLM: Phi-3: 6K chars<br/>Qwen/Llama: 32K chars
    LLM->>LLM: Generate response (max 500 tokens)
    LLM-->>UI: Answer with [Title](rec:id) references

    UI->>UI: Parse [Title](rec:id) links<br/>→ Clickable spans
    UI-->>User: Display formatted answer

    User->>UI: Click [Recording Title]
    UI->>UI: Navigate to EntryDetailPage
